    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάν-θοινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (and
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
