				<i>splendidly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαῖτα πανθοίνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					95.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τράπεζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.221
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παν[θοίν]ην</span> is dub. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.49
			</span></i>.</div>
